.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt PATH_ACCESS 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm path_access
.Nd check file accessibility and permissions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In path.h
.Ft int
.Fn path_access "const char *path" "int rights"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn path_access
function checks whether the calling process can access the file specified by
.Fa path
according to the requested permissions
.Fa rights
(such as
.Dv R_OK ,
.Dv W_OK ,
or
.Dv X_OK ).
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns non-zero if the requested access is permitted, or 0 if access is denied or an error occurred.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr path_exists 3 ,
.Xr path_is_directory 3